      "text_tajweed_html": "فَوَيْ<tajweed class=idgham_wo_ghunnah>لٌ ل</tajweed>ِّلْمُصَلّ<tajweed class=madda_permissible>ِي</tajweed>نَ <span class=end>٤</span>"
